HST Office: "Báo lỗi cho HASON TECH…" in the Help section of the Tabbed ribbon's ≡ menu of Writer, Sheets and Slides.

The entry runs org.hst.office.vi:ReportError of the bundled HST extension (the error report dialog). Its label is
Vietnamese in every UI language, like the other HST commands. The classic Help menu and the Start Center get the
same entry from the extension (Addons.xcu, OfficeHelp).

